    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="13.7">
        <head>Cn 1018 13.7</head>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#kennedy" n="13.7" corresp="#wit-d">And gif man ænig lic of rihtre scriftscire. elles hwar lecge. gelæste man þone sawlsceat swa ðeah into ðam mynstre. þe hit to hyrde.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-d">And gif man ænig lic of rihtre scriftscire elles hwar lecge, gelæste man þone sawlsceat swa ðeah into ðam mynstre þe hit to hyrde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#kennedy" corresp="#wit-d">And if any body is buried elsewhere than in the right parish, the payment should nevertheless be made to the church to which it belongs.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-d">And if any person’s body is buried other than in its proper parish, the dues should still be paid to the church to which he belonged.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
